.SH "ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES"
.PP
wlog environment variables
.RS 4
@MANPAGE_NAME@ uses wLog as its log facility, you can refer to the corresponding man page (wlog(7)) for more information\&. Arguments passed via the
\fI/log\-level\fR
or
\fI/log\-filters\fR
have precedence over the environment variables\&.
.br
.RE
.PP
freerdp environment variables
.RS 4
Various configurations of the core library can be configured with environment variables as well. Consult (freerdp(7)) for more information\&.
.RE

.PP
FREERDP_ASKPASS
.RS 4
Set a program to ask for passwords similar to \fISSH_ASKPASS\fR
.RE
